  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s1: a host probe stops failing
  s1 --> s2: dcserver stops
  s1 --> s3: a message reserves a new execution
  s2 --> s4: dcserver starts
  s3 --> s5: the host creates it
  s4 --> s6: intake opens
  s5 --> s5: the provider starts in the pane
  s6 --> s7: a message reserves a new execution
  s5 --> s8: its pane is recorded
  s7 --> s9: the host creates it
  s8 --> s10: the turn binds the execution
  s9 --> s11: its pane is recorded
  s10 --> s12: an end is requested
  s11 --> s13: the host server ends
  s12 --> s14: a message arrives
  s13 --> s15: the host server starts again
  s14 --> s16: the close is sent
  s15 --> s17: the turn is refused: no provider in the pane
  s16 --> s18: the owned provider is confirmed gone
  s17 --> s15: a message arrives
  s18 --> s1: the row is retired
  s15 --> s19: the turn is refused: no provider in the pane
  s3 --> s20: the host server ends
  s20 --> s21: the create reply is lost
  s21 --> s22: the census finds nothing and closes the row
  s22 --> s23: the host server starts again
  s23 --> s24: a message reserves a new execution
  s24 --> s25: the host creates it
  s25 --> s26: its pane is recorded
  s26 --> s27: the turn is refused: no provider in the pane
  s27 --> s28: dcserver stops
  s28 --> s28: the provider starts in the pane
  s28 --> s29: dcserver starts
  s29 --> s30: intake opens
